  <running_head>MATERIA DE ACTIONIBUS / RVM.</running_head>
  <bottom_margin>
    <signature>******* 3</signature>
  </bottom_margin>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" type="heading" level="2" para="true">§. 2.</l>
    <l n="2">1. Multiplex est in rem actio.</l>
    <l n="3">2. Quid sit confessoria &amp; negatoria.</l>
    <l n="4" type="heading" level="2" para="true">§. 3.</l>
    <l n="5" para="true">Actiones vel praetoria vel civiles.</l>
    <l n="6" type="heading" level="2" para="true">§. 4.</l>
    <l n="7">1. Publiciana quid sit?</l>
    <l n="8">2. An detur contra verum dominum?</l>
    <l n="9">3. Quid moribus?</l>
    <l n="10">4. Quid jure Canonum?</l>
    <l n="11" type="heading" level="2" para="true">§. 5.</l>
    <l n="12">1. Quid sit actio rescissoria?</l>
    <l n="13">2. Non est duplex remedium, aliud</l>
    <l n="14">restituens, aliud rescissorium.</l>
    <l n="15">3. Moribus quid obtineat?</l>
    <l n="16">4. Quid jure Canonico?</l>
    <l n="17" type="heading" level="2" para="true">§. 6.</l>
    <l n="18">1. Pauliana explicatur.</l>
    <l n="19">2. Quid veniat nomine alienationis?</l>
    <l n="20">3. Filius non petens legitimam, nihil</l>
    <l n="21">agit in fraudem creditorum.</l>
    <l n="22">4. Fratres forte amplam dotem</l>
    <l n="23">sororis legitimam revocare poterunt?</l>
    <l n="24">5. Quid Calvisiana &amp; Fabiana?</l>
    <l n="25">6. Quid moribus?</l>
    <l n="26" type="heading" level="2" para="true">§. 7.</l>
    <l n="27">1. Quid Serviana?</l>
    <l n="28">2. Utrum merces in tabernam illata</l>
    <l n="29">sint pignori?</l>
    <l n="30">3. Quid quasi Serviana?</l>
    <l n="31">4. Quid interdictum Salvianum?</l>
    <l n="32">5. Quid moribus?</l>
    <l n="33" type="heading" level="2" para="true">§. 8. 6.</l>
    <l n="34">1. Quid fuerit actio receptitia?</l>
    <l n="35">2. Quid constitutum?</l>
    <l n="36">3. Exemplum constituti in sacro codice.</l>
    <l n="37">4. Quid moribus?</l>
    <l n="38" type="heading" level="2" para="true">§. 10.</l>
    <l n="39" para="true">Quid sit actio de peculio?</l>
    <l n="40">§. 11.</l>
    <l n="41">1. Actio ex jurejurando explicatur.</l>
    <l n="42">2. An actori ex jurejurando nova competat actio?</l>
    <l n="43">§. 12.</l>
    <l n="44">1. Poenales praetoriae actiones recensentur.</l>
    <l n="45">2. Vocula bene pro valde capitur.</l>
    <l n="46">3. Actio poenalis, si quis in jus vocatum ex-</l>
    <l n="47">emerit, explicatur.</l>
    <l n="48">4. Quid moribus?</l>
    <l n="49">§. 13.</l>
    <l n="50">1.</l>
    <l n="51">Praejudicium quot modis capiatur?</l>
    <l n="52">2. Quid moribus?</l>
    <l n="53">§. 15.</l>
    <l n="54">1. Differentia inter actionem in rem &amp;</l>
    <l n="55">in personam explicatur.</l>
    <l n="56">2. Quid moribus?</l>
    <l n="57">§. 17.18.19.21. Usque ad §. 28.</l>
    <l n="58">1. Sequitur actionum divisio ab effectu desumpta.</l>
    <l n="59">2. Quid moribus?</l>
    <l n="60">§. 20.</l>
    <l n="61">Non dantur proprie actiones mista.</l>
    <l n="62">§. 28.</l>
    <l n="63">Actiones sunt vel bonae fidei vel stricti</l>
    <l n="64">juris.</l>
    <l n="65">§. 29.</l>
    <l n="66">1. Actio ex stipulatu de dote, qualis sit?</l>
    <l n="67">2. Quid moribus?</l>
    <l n="68">§. 30.</l>
    <l n="69">1. Multiplex inter actiones bonae fidei &amp;</l>
    <l n="70">stricti juris differentia proponitur.</l>
    <l n="71">2. Quid moribus?</l>
    <l n="72">§. 31.</l>
    <l n="73">Arbitrarias actiones explicantur.</l>
    <l n="74">§. 32.</l>
    <l n="75">Sententia judicis quoad fieri po-</l>
    <l n="76">test, debet esse certa.</l>
    <l n="77">§. 33.</l>
  </main_text>
